## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of arguments).
Let mutable sum be 0.
Let mutable i be 0.
While i is less than n:
    Let yy be 2000 + (i % 50).
    Let mo be 1 + (i % 12).
    Let dd be 1 + (i % 28).
    Let hh be i % 24.
    Let mm be i % 60.
    Let ss be i % 60.
    Set sum to (sum + timegm(yy, mo, dd, hh, mm, ss)) % 1000000007.
    Set i to i + 1.
Show sum.
